  "description": "Variation of condition 1 (Approved Plans), 8 (Cycle Parking) and 12 (Means of Enclosure) of planning permission reference 24/4304/FUL dated 24/12/24 for 'Demolition of the existing dwelling and erection of a new two storey dwelling including new basement level with associated lightwells and rooms in the roof space with 2no. side and 2no. rear dormers and 3no. front facing rooflights and 5no. rooflights to the roof.   Installation of 3no. air conditioning units on the flank elevation.  Provision of external amenity space, 2no. off-street parking spaces, cycle storage (in the rear garden) and refuse and recycling facilities.' Variation to include: Changes to elevations including design and changes to front bay windows; Alterations to basement footprint; Replacement of 2no. ground floor rooflights to glass louvre rooflights; Changes to first floor roof parapet; Alterations to rear and side dormers; Alterations to the rooflights on central crown; Changes to fenestration; Changes to refuse and cycle storage; Alterations to boundary treatments",
